<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Metway says merger has court okay.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Metway says merger has court okay.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metway Bank Ltd said on Wednesday that schemes of arrangement which are a precursor to its merger into a Queensland government financial services conglomerate had received court approval.</p>
<p>The bank plans to merge with the government's Queensland Industry Development Corp (QIDC) and Suncorp Insurance and Finance, with these two firms subject to the schemes of arrangement.</p>
<p>Metway shareholders are meeting on Wednesday morning to vote on the merger with Suncorp and QIDC, forming a A$21 billion financial services group.  -- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
